# Local environment variables for Wrangler Pages dev.
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` and fill in your real API keys.
# `.dev.vars` is gitignored — never commit your real keys.
#
# Anthropic key (auto-translate):  https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# Ticketmaster key (events fetch): https://developer.ticketmaster.com/my-apps/apps
#   → use the app's "Consumer Key" (the Discovery API needs only the key).
#
# Once .dev.vars exists, `npm run dev` (which runs `wrangler dev`) injects these
# into the Worker runtime, so /api/claude-proxy, /api/rss-fetch, and
# /api/ticketmaster-fetch can reach their upstreams.
#
# For PRODUCTION, set the same vars in:
#   Cloudflare Dashboard → Pages → your project → Settings → Environment Variables

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-api03-replace-me
TICKETMASTER_KEY=your-ticketmaster-consumer-key
